OL,3,AFrench blood storage impacted by
OL,4,Afreezer hacks as theories swirl about
OL,5,Aculprits
OL,6,
OL,7,FFrench authorities say that fridges
OL,8,Fused in medical facilities to store
OL,9,Fblood for donations were impacted by
OL,10,Frecent cyber-attacks by unknown
OL,11,Fhackers.
OL,13,FThe French Blood Establishment (EFS)
OL,14,Fsaid cold rooms storing blood were
OL,15,Fimpacted by hackers, with temperatures
OL,16,Fset to rise - but staff intervened to
OL,17,Fprotect blood supplies.
OL,19,F"No health impact has been identified
OL,20,Fand no loss of blood products is to be
OL,21,Freported," the EFS said.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
